{
  "about": "The English messages the Energy move's model introduced (src/core/i18n/en.ts, energy.*, the detail's (#240) included), each with sample values. test/unit/i18n/moved-strings.test.ts asserts that the French catalog renders what the rewrite layer made of the English; `frame` is the sentence a text is read in where the layer translates it only there, `written` is French the layer does not make (a text it left in English, or a combination of words it has no entry for), `fr` the values French writes differently. #241 deleted the map entries the legacy panel no longer renders: `was` is what the layer made of the English before, `after` what it makes of it now (a pattern of the layer, `(.+): (.+)`, still reads some of the dead texts; nothing shows them). The entries another screen still renders stay: Idle, Heating and Water heater (the Home water tile and the live pill), `{n} kWh today`, `low rate`, `medium rate` and `rate unknown` (the Home energy tile's line), `Heating · {n} kW` and `Heating, {n} days` (the Climate rooms and sheet), `at {n}¢/kWh` (the Car sheet) and `Challenge:` (the upcoming list). Deleted with the layer in phase 4.",
